; features (docs/ART.md 5.5): scattered uprights (forests, jungle, scrub, shards) and single sprites.
; Painted by tools/atlas/compose_map.py at the sprites' own resolution: pines and palms by pixel
; rules (lit west edge, shaded east, dark undersides), canopies and floes as lit domes; one void
; outline round the silhouette, none on thin strokes or flat ground marks.

